Great news — **.NET 10 has native MTP support** in `dotnet test`, and **no, you don't need `TestingPlatformDotnetTestSupport`**. That property is only for .NET 9 and earlier.

### What to do

Add a `test` section to your `global.json`:

```json
{
  "sdk": {
    "version": "10.0.100"
  },
  "test": {
    "runner": "Microsoft.Testing.Platform"
  }
}
```

